sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal-specimen-match> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Ho et al. (2019) & Painter, Ho & Headon (2018) avian feather tracts on a curved trunk-and-limb surface: geodesic EDA competence wave, inhibitory-disk hexagonal packing, density-threshold tract boundaries and curvature-induced 5-7 dislocations — Morphological realism / specimen match: 92/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Vendors and SHA-256-verifies Ho et al. (2019) PLOS Biology 17(2):e3000132 Fig 3 (`chick_feather_bud_hexagonal_specimen.jpg`, CC BY 4.0) and segments it (`segment_feather_tract_specimen`, L971-1025): 24 CTNNB1 / EDA primordia in Panel B ROI [494, 24, 770, 218] with Voronoi / Delaunay coordination P_6 = 0.7500 (9/12 interior), P_567 = 1.0, |psi_6| = 0.5265, NN spacing 40.33 +- 7.96 px (CV 0.1974), and the Panel A +24h -> +48h tract expansion 38 / 18 = 2.11x. The comparison figure (Panels G-H, L1172-1190) now sets the specimen against the correct Ho 2019 anchors (P_6 ~0.75 control vs ~0.50 Latrunculin-paused) instead of the invented v2 value 0.9167. Held at 92: the curved trunk + limb-bud surface is a schematic Monge patch, not segmented from an embryo image, so the new curved-tract outputs are compared to flat controls and to theory, not to a specimen." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "docs/media/avian_feather_bud_hexagonal_curved_tracts.png (generated output, not in repo): Flat vs curved vs curved-simultaneous three-tract lattices with 5-7 dislocation pairs highlighted; no specimen counterpart for the curved geometry — docs/media/avian_feather_bud_hexagonal_curved_tracts.png: rendered output of 2018-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal.py at d58a084, image/png, 1266076 B, 2141×667 px, artifact_sha256 c1f3802617c58adbf252533981b61c4cd8dd0dc266ddd8d93db4a2c705f67bbc (sha256 c1f3802617c58adbf252533981b61c4cd8dd0dc266ddd8d93db4a2c705f67bbc), spec_fingerprint 3fbee933f34698c1174f68ad05c98568d7506c7ded5d60e6139c6071b4be189e" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal-specimen-match-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal-specimen-match-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal-specimen-match-3> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.92"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal-specimen-match-1> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2018-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal.py L971–L1025" ;
        dct:description "DoG peak segmentation, Voronoi/Delaunay coordination and +48h/+24h expansion on the SHA-256-locked Ho 2019 Fig 3 specimen" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2018-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal.py#L971-L1025> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal-specimen-match-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2018-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal.py L1172–L1190" ;
        dct:description "Panels G-H: specimen ROIs and Voronoi overlay juxtaposed with model WT P_6" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2018-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal.py#L1172-L1190> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal-specimen-match-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "docs/media/avian_feather_bud_hexagonal_comparison.png (generated output)" ;
        dct:description "12-panel figure with specimen (G), specimen Voronoi (H), flat and curved model lattices, kymograph, sweeps and EDA density-threshold bars — docs/media/avian_feather_bud_hexagonal_comparison.png: rendered output of 2018-glimm-avian-feather-bud-hexagonal.py at d58a084, image/png, 1618568 B, 2934×2025 px, artifact_sha256 ba009d31e0385026103342b2010994117e85753b24af6da1eb9e321c9ab2511d (sha256 ba009d31e0385026103342b2010994117e85753b24af6da1eb9e321c9ab2511d), spec_fingerprint 3fbee933f34698c1174f68ad05c98568d7506c7ded5d60e6139c6071b4be189e" .
